# Visual Language: Care Reality, Not Chat

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-visual-language.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-visual-language.md)

## Principle

Not ChatGPT / WhatsApp. Caregiver contributes care reality; SolenOS structures understanding.

## Colors

- Caregiver note: `#F3EFE7` / `#1F2937` / border `#E5DDD0`  
- Understanding: white + accent `#52796F`  
- Unknowns: `#F3EFE7` — never red alarm  

## Never

Chat bubbles · AI avatar · typing indicators · “ask me anything” · blue/gray message threads

## Build

Care cards · Current understanding · What changed · Still unclear · FAB “+ Tell us what happened”

Mobile-first. Product test: without AI labels, still a living care record.
